      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami areeba bukambisi bwa Isaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga omwami Hesekia ne aulila kamakhuwa kabwe, atabula chingubo chewe mu bubeeleli, efwara likunia mala acha mu Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aruma Eliakimu owemeelelanga lichipi lio mwami, Shebuna omuandiki ne basaayi bakhulu bache khu mung'oosi Isaya okhwa Amozi. Boosi baba bafwarire kamakunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baboolela Isaya bali, “Hesekia aloma ali, endaalo yino eli endaalo eye bubeeleli, kumunaanio ne eye chisoni. Khuli nga omukhasi ne ali embi khusaala mala se ali ne kamaani ke khusaala omwana oyo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakana Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo auliile kamakhuwa koosi niko Rabushake, niye omwami wewe owa Ashuru arumire khukhoma Wele omenyile mindali. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola ario aana kumunaanio khu makhuwa niko auliile. Khwako sabila abo balarama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barume bo mwami Hesekia becha khu Isaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya ababoolela ali, “Boolela omwami muli, kano niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma: ‘Mukhaba ne buuri khu makhuwa niko muulile tawe. Mukheembeelela khulwe kamakhuwa kamabi niko bakholi bo mwami owa Ashuru balomile khwise tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, ndamuramo kumwoyo kwe buuri ne alaulila kamakhuwa kakhamanyikhaane tawe mala alakobola mu sibala siewe. Ne endamukhola ererwe mu sibala siewe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baashuru barikhirisa lundi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabushake akobolayo mala anyoola omwami owa Ashuru alikho apana ne lukoba lwa Libuna. Aba auliile ali omwami arurire e Lakishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa liolela omwami bali omwami Tirihaka owa Kushi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kushi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kushi lili lisina liikhalaakhale lie sibala sibalaayi ebunafubo we lifubukho lie khunyoa lie luluuchi lwa Naili. Sibala sino luno luri silimo bibala bia Esopia (Abisinia), Sudani, nende aundi bibiindi biili siimbi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " echile khumwibwaakala. Arumania lundi barumwa khu Hesekia ne aloma ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Boolela Hesekia owa Yuda muli, okhalekha Wele niye wiyikina oyo akhubea tawe. Okhamusuubila ne aloma ali lukoba lwa Yerusalemu se lulaebwa khu mwami owa Ashuru tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola ewe wauliile niko babaami ba Ashuru bakhola bibala bioosi. Babionakilanga elala. Ewe wibaasia oli olaresibwa ku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuka base babunia chingoba cha Kosani, Harani ne Resefu. Lundi babunia babaandu ba Beti-edeni babamenyanga mu Telasari. Ne bawele be babaandu babaonia ku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaami be chingoba cha Hamati, Aripadi, Sefaribaimu, Hena ne Iba bali waena?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Hesekia abukula ebarwa khukhwama khu barumwa mala akisoma. Acha mu Lukaangu, aara ebarwa eyo ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khur. 25.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hesekia asaba ne aloma ali, “Ee, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli owekhala khu ndebe yowo eye bubwami angaaki we kerubi. Ewe weng'ene niwe Wele. Ewe Wele owe bubwami bwoosi bwe khwiloba. Wakhola liloba ne likulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rekeeresia Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, mala oulile. Moka, ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala obone. Ulila kamakhuwa ka Senakeribu niko arumaniisie khukhukhoma ewe, Wele omenyile mindali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ali ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi babaami ba Ashuru babuniisie chikholo chingali ne kamaloba kacho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bosia bawele babwe sikila se baba wele tawe ne kakhali biaba bikholwa bio omwana owo omundu. Bionakwa sikila biaba kimirongooro ne kamabaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono luno, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe ekhusaba, khureesie efwe khukhwama khu Baashuru nio bibala bioosi bie khwiloba bilamanya bili ewe, Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi weng'ene oli Wele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Burume bwa Isaya khu mwami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Isaya okhwa Amozi aruma burume aboolela omwami Hesekia ali, kano niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi owa Isiraeli aloma: Nauliile lisaba liowo khwise khuloondekhana no mwami Senakeribu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma khu Senakeribu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya aboolela omwami Hesekia ali, “Esino sikhabe simanyisio sie kamakhuwa kaakhekholekhe, kumwiiko kuno mulalia biakhulia bibuukha bibieene, kumwiiko kwe khabili mukhalie biakhulia birombanga khu bibuukha ne kumwiiko kwe khataru miicha biakhulia mala mubikese. Lundi biaala kimisabibu mala mulie chisabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaliona mu Yuda bakhasisine nga kumurogooro mala basaale baame kamatuunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khukhabe ne babaandu bakharame e Yerusalemu, khu sikulu sia Sayuni babaandu batiiti bakharame. Sinani sia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe banamae nisio siikhakhole kano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma khuloondekhana no mwami owa Ashuru ali, se akheche mu lukoba luno namwe alasemo luembo, namwe alwichekho ne engabo namwe ombakhekho abuundu e khubotookhelesia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali Senakeribu alikobolela khu muyila nikwo echelakho ne kumwene, ne se alingila mu lukoba luno tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekhasute lukoba luno nduonie khulwe lisina liase ne khulwo omukholi wase Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siilo esio malaika owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi acha mu kambi eye Baashuru mala eera banamae chielefu emia ndala ne chielefu kamakhumi munane na chiraano. Nga babaandu ne benyokha makhelebeende banyoola bafu bong'ene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Senakeribu omwami owa Ashuru arekukha mala acha engo, mala amenya e Ninefe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo ndala Senakeribu aba alikho esaaya wele wewe Nisiroki munju eya wele wewe. Basoleeli bewe babili, Adurameleki ne Sharesa, bamwiira mala belukhila mu sibala sia Ararati. Nio omusoleeli wewe Esarihatoni amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe aba omwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
